WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.850
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:24.120 --> 00:25.400
Greetings, Commander.

3
00:25.400 --> 00:27.530
You've been working hard, Commander.

4
00:31.350 --> 00:32.560
Rest assured, Commander.

5
00:32.560 --> 00:34.110
Everything is normal in Qianshan.

6
00:34.110 --> 00:36.070
Under your wise and capable governance,

7
00:36.070 --> 00:38.310
not a single opium pipe can be found in Qianshan now.

8
00:38.310 --> 00:39.280
We will show no mercy

9
00:39.280 --> 00:40.500
to anyone caught hiding one.

10
00:40.500 --> 00:42.540
The people all sing your praises.

11
00:42.660 --> 00:45.430
You're getting better and better at talking.

12
00:46.130 --> 00:48.190
I'm only back here catching my breath

13
00:48.310 --> 00:50.960
because over 1,000 of my men gave their lives for it.

14
00:50.960 --> 00:53.240
The ceasefire is only temporary.

15
00:53.430 --> 00:56.880
Your Guard Corps will inevitably be sent to the front lines as well.

16
00:56.880 --> 00:58.740
You'd better prepare in advance.

17
01:00.360 --> 01:01.290
Yes, Commander.

18
01:02.710 --> 01:03.750
Reporting, Commander.

19
01:03.750 --> 01:04.550
She's here.

20
01:18.110 --> 01:19.370
Do you find her pretty?

21
01:20.110 --> 01:21.030
I wouldn't dare, Commander.

22
01:21.030 --> 01:21.800
You may leave.

23
01:21.800 --> 01:23.390
Then I'll take my leave.

24
01:27.440 --> 01:28.640
It's been a long time,

25
01:28.830 --> 01:29.800
Miss Jiang.

26
03:10.280 --> 03:14.200
[A Prophet]

27
03:14.960 --> 03:16.930
[Episode 5]

28
03:17.800 --> 03:18.800
Corpse Driving?

29
03:19.710 --> 03:21.590
It's a form of sorcery practiced in Xiangxi.

30
03:21.590 --> 03:22.960
Back when there were wars,

31
03:22.960 --> 03:24.960
many people from Xiangxi died far from home.

32
03:24.960 --> 03:26.360
Some local sorcerers

33
03:26.430 --> 03:27.710
would then use soul-summoning rituals

34
03:27.710 --> 03:29.240
to gather their three souls and seven spirits

35
03:29.240 --> 03:30.480
back into the corpses.

36
03:30.480 --> 03:32.240
That way, they could bring the bodies home

37
03:32.240 --> 03:34.520
so the dead wouldn't become wandering ghosts.

38
03:34.520 --> 03:36.320
We actually do this kind of work?

39
03:36.710 --> 03:37.550
Well, there you go.

40
03:37.550 --> 03:38.320
I'm telling you,

41
03:38.320 --> 03:39.390
our Longxuya Corpse Driving

42
03:39.390 --> 03:41.050
is really famous around here.

43
03:41.829 --> 03:43.030
They call it sorcery,

44
03:43.240 --> 03:45.110
but in reality, it's all done by living people.

45
03:45.110 --> 03:46.640
Exactly. It's all done by living people.

46
03:46.640 --> 03:48.430
They wash the corpses clean.

47
03:48.520 --> 03:49.550
Then they take a knife

48
03:49.550 --> 03:50.200
to cut them open,

49
03:50.200 --> 03:51.240
remove all the internal organs,

50
03:51.240 --> 03:52.240
and fill the body cavities with a preservative solution

51
03:52.240 --> 03:52.920
to keep them from rotting.

52
03:52.920 --> 03:53.760
Once the bodies have dried,

53
03:53.760 --> 03:54.590
they tie them to poles

54
03:54.590 --> 03:55.200
and string them together.

55
03:55.200 --> 03:56.110
Then two strong men

56
03:56.110 --> 03:57.550
can carry them all the way home.

57
03:57.550 --> 03:58.760
After all that,

58
03:59.040 --> 04:02.240
would anyone still believe in the whole three souls and seven spirits story?

59
04:02.240 --> 04:04.080
That's where our cleverness comes in.

60
04:04.080 --> 04:04.640
Let me tell you,

61
04:04.640 --> 04:05.830
these corpse drivers

62
04:05.830 --> 04:07.760
dress the corpses in burial robes.

63
04:07.830 --> 04:08.990
Then those two strong men

64
04:08.990 --> 04:10.250
dress up as corpses too

65
04:10.480 --> 04:12.410
and make the corpses "jump" along.

66
04:13.550 --> 04:14.550
If anyone happens

67
04:14.640 --> 04:16.269
to stop and watch along the way,

68
04:16.269 --> 04:18.029
they pull little tricks like making the corpses rise

69
04:18.029 --> 04:20.180
or pretending there are ghosts, just to scare them away.

70
04:20.180 --> 04:23.110
They'd go home and spread the story from door to door.

71
04:24.030 --> 04:27.680
No wonder Xiangxi Corpse Driving has been passed down for a thousand years.

72
04:27.680 --> 04:29.470
Anyway, back to the matter at hand.

73
04:29.470 --> 04:31.230
Mr. Zheng's coal mine in Anping

74
04:31.230 --> 04:32.909
had a mining accident recently,

75
04:32.909 --> 04:34.909
and his son was buried underground.

76
04:35.080 --> 04:36.470
He hired us

77
04:36.510 --> 04:38.370
to bring the body back for burial.

78
04:38.409 --> 04:40.740
Heng is already waiting for you in Anping.

79
04:41.150 --> 04:42.100
Who is Heng?

80
04:43.200 --> 04:44.330
The Chief's nephew.

81
04:44.390 --> 04:46.030
Zheng Tianming is hosting a banquet

82
04:46.030 --> 04:47.890
at Sanyuan Restaurant tomorrow.

83
04:48.190 --> 04:49.110
Ruhui,

84
04:49.630 --> 04:50.950
Starting tomorrow,

85
04:51.710 --> 04:53.760
you'll be the 18th-generation successor

86
04:53.760 --> 04:55.350
to Xiangxi Corpse Driving.

87
04:55.790 --> 04:56.520
Me?

88
05:02.710 --> 05:05.080
Sir, spare me a bite to eat.

89
05:05.350 --> 05:06.880
Please, I'm begging you.

90
05:14.030 --> 05:15.270
Thank you, sir.

91
05:20.080 --> 05:23.880
[No. 26, Jiudao Kan. Come see me at once.]

92
05:31.830 --> 05:33.520
Have you looked into Zheng Tianming?

93
05:33.520 --> 05:34.640
He does exist.

94
05:35.440 --> 05:37.710
And there really is a mine in Anping.

95
05:38.720 --> 05:42.540
Why would Blind Du specifically send you for this Corpse Driving task?

96
05:42.540 --> 05:44.770
Blind Du probably has other dealings with Zheng Tianming,

97
05:44.770 --> 05:46.830
so he considers him quite important.

98
05:46.890 --> 05:49.010
It makes sense for me to go

99
05:49.030 --> 05:50.830
as a successor of Xiangxi Corpse Driving.

100
05:50.830 --> 05:51.590
Besides,

101
05:51.830 --> 05:53.159
if anything goes wrong,

102
05:53.440 --> 05:55.030
they can pin the blame on me

103
05:55.230 --> 05:57.159
instead of implicating Longxuya.

104
05:58.909 --> 06:01.080
Corpse Driving isn't some elaborate scheme.

105
06:01.080 --> 06:02.640
It's just transporting bodies back

106
06:02.640 --> 06:04.270
and making a few bucks for the work.

107
06:04.270 --> 06:05.440
What could go wrong?

108
06:07.830 --> 06:09.320
If this really is just Corpse Driving,

109
06:09.320 --> 06:11.380
Longxuya has plenty of low-level men

110
06:11.910 --> 06:13.370
Mr. Zheng has seen before.

111
06:20.640 --> 06:23.640
You got through the Pangzhou affair far too smoothly.

112
06:23.760 --> 06:24.590
I know

113
06:25.150 --> 06:27.080
you look down on the Tianxiang Sect

114
06:27.270 --> 06:28.710
and on Blind Du.

115
06:29.270 --> 06:30.470
But I'm warning you,

116
06:31.520 --> 06:33.760
they're all wolves in human form.

117
06:34.230 --> 06:35.830
If you underestimate them,

118
06:36.200 --> 06:39.320
they'll swallow you whole, flesh and skin,

119
06:40.150 --> 06:42.480
without leaving so much as a scrap of bone.

120
06:42.620 --> 06:44.590
Whatever comes, we'll handle it.

121
06:45.680 --> 06:47.710
If there really is something fishy going on,

122
06:47.710 --> 06:48.570
I'm not afraid.

123
06:53.710 --> 06:54.390
All right.

124
06:56.230 --> 06:57.790
Since you've already agreed,

125
06:57.790 --> 06:58.680
then go ahead.

126
06:59.710 --> 07:01.370
Just be careful along the way.

127
07:02.660 --> 07:03.100
Yes.

128
07:06.680 --> 07:08.610
Have you been to Blind Du's hideout

129
07:08.760 --> 07:09.470
before?

130
07:11.390 --> 07:14.320
But it's heavily guarded and not easy to infiltrate.

131
07:14.350 --> 07:15.150
That's one of the reasons

132
07:15.150 --> 07:17.320
I agreed to this Corpse Driving task.

133
07:18.230 --> 07:19.000
Besides,

134
07:22.310 --> 07:24.370
I've noticed something suspicious.

135
08:02.120 --> 08:04.560
So you're the expert from Xiangxi.

136
08:04.770 --> 08:06.030
What should I call you?

137
08:06.030 --> 08:07.030
My surname is Lyu.

138
08:08.710 --> 08:09.590
Mr. Lyu,

139
08:10.030 --> 08:11.160
please, have a seat.

140
08:12.880 --> 08:14.010
I deal with the dead,

141
08:14.150 --> 08:15.710
so I carry a strong corpse aura.

142
08:15.710 --> 08:17.570
I shouldn't be around the living.

143
08:18.640 --> 08:19.350
Mr. Lyu,

144
08:19.420 --> 08:20.540
I've asked you here

145
08:20.590 --> 08:21.790
to help

146
08:21.790 --> 08:24.390
bring my son's body back from Anping.

147
08:25.030 --> 08:27.790
I have only one son, my sole heir.

148
08:27.890 --> 08:29.890
Now that we're separated by life and death,

149
08:29.890 --> 08:31.280
this is all

150
08:32.630 --> 08:33.990
I can do for him.

151
08:34.990 --> 08:35.850
Bring the lamp.

152
08:40.280 --> 08:40.870
What...

153
08:41.830 --> 08:42.960
What does this mean?

154
08:43.240 --> 08:44.280
Mr. Zheng,

155
08:44.680 --> 08:46.300
please clear your mind for now

156
08:46.300 --> 08:48.780
and recall your son's face and voice.

157
09:08.070 --> 09:09.630
W-W-What's going on?

158
09:09.920 --> 09:11.590
The lamp lit itself without any fire.

159
09:11.590 --> 09:13.100
This lamp is called a Soul-Guiding Lamp.

160
09:13.100 --> 09:15.810
It is meant to guide your son's spirit home.

161
09:16.030 --> 09:17.790
You'll also need to place this lamp

162
09:17.790 --> 09:19.520
in the family mourning hall.

163
09:19.740 --> 09:20.860
After seven days,

164
09:21.230 --> 09:22.760
when we return with the body

165
09:22.800 --> 09:24.710
and his wandering soul returns to the body,

166
09:24.710 --> 09:25.840
the lamp will go out.

167
09:26.630 --> 09:27.590
In that case,

168
09:28.110 --> 09:29.240
I'll leave it to you,

169
09:29.510 --> 09:30.920
Mr. Lyu.

170
09:37.170 --> 09:41.420
[Anping]

171
09:37.760 --> 09:38.400
Let's go.

172
09:56.080 --> 09:56.800
Senior Du.

173
09:58.280 --> 09:59.010
You're here.

174
10:00.040 --> 10:00.640
Come on in.

175
10:00.830 --> 10:01.360
Let's go.

176
10:03.630 --> 10:03.990
Come on,

177
10:03.990 --> 10:04.450
inside.

178
10:09.350 --> 10:10.950
This is Zheng Qigong's body.

179
10:11.080 --> 10:12.830
The others are the bodies of his fellow townsmen.

180
10:12.830 --> 10:14.040
We'll take them all back together.

181
10:14.040 --> 10:14.750
Senior Du,

182
10:15.280 --> 10:16.870
how many strings of coins did you hang up,

183
10:16.870 --> 10:19.000
and how many talismans did you put out?

184
10:19.920 --> 10:21.110
Everything was done according to the usual practice.

185
10:21.110 --> 10:21.780
No problem.

186
10:25.320 --> 10:26.320
I've got everything ready.

187
10:26.320 --> 10:26.990
No need to check.

188
10:26.990 --> 10:27.900
You must be tired from the journey.

189
10:27.900 --> 10:28.630
Have some water.

190
10:28.630 --> 10:29.040
Come,

191
10:29.350 --> 10:29.880
sit down.

192
10:30.870 --> 10:33.200
I've got everything you need ready for you.

193
10:33.200 --> 10:35.200
Let's hurry and get you dressed up.

194
10:35.230 --> 10:36.230
Once it gets dark,

195
10:36.230 --> 10:38.030
we'll get on the road right away.

196
10:38.510 --> 10:39.110
All right.

197
10:39.560 --> 10:40.490
What's this for?

198
10:41.560 --> 10:43.160
Who's supposed to wear this?

199
10:50.200 --> 10:52.400
When the dead pass through,

200
10:52.990 --> 10:55.230
the living must keep their distance.

201
10:55.730 --> 10:57.730
Copper bells lead the way.

202
10:58.560 --> 11:00.750
The road to the underworld opens.

203
11:01.440 --> 11:03.280
We escort the dead home,

204
11:03.990 --> 11:05.850
so they may return to their roots.

205
11:06.830 --> 11:09.230
The dead carry yin energy and evil spirits;

206
11:09.280 --> 11:11.340
the living must keep their distance.

207
11:12.440 --> 11:14.590
When the dead pass through,

208
11:15.350 --> 11:17.470
the living must keep their distance.

209
11:18.400 --> 11:20.440
Copper bells lead the way.

210
11:21.110 --> 11:23.350
The road to the underworld opens.

211
11:24.400 --> 11:25.800
Halt.

212
11:26.320 --> 11:27.450
It'll be light soon.

213
11:27.830 --> 11:28.760
We'll camp here.

214
11:29.830 --> 11:30.470
Senior Du,

215
11:30.750 --> 11:32.430
how are we supposed to sleep out here?

216
11:32.430 --> 11:33.830
There's a river up ahead.

217
11:33.830 --> 11:35.160
We'll camp by the river.

218
11:35.440 --> 11:36.370
The woods by the river

219
11:36.370 --> 11:37.770
are lush and full of life.

220
11:38.110 --> 11:39.510
Resting the corpses against the trees

221
11:39.510 --> 11:43.040
will keep their three souls and seven spirits from dispersing.

222
11:43.360 --> 11:44.070
Senior Du,

223
11:44.510 --> 11:46.870
I know Corpse Driving is supposed to be done by night and rest by day.

224
11:46.870 --> 11:49.160
But shouldn't we rest when we get to the mortuary?

225
11:49.160 --> 11:51.390
If these bodies get mauled by wild animals in the mountains,

226
11:51.390 --> 11:52.920
we'll have a hard time explaining it when we get back.

227
11:52.920 --> 11:54.520
Why do you have so much to say?

228
11:54.540 --> 11:56.200
We'll rest where I say we rest.

229
11:56.570 --> 11:57.860
How about we switch? You carry them.

230
11:57.860 --> 11:58.410
No, no.

231
12:01.960 --> 12:04.200
Why aren't we resting at the mortuary?

232
12:04.510 --> 12:07.400
This is such a miserable place to spend the night.

233
12:08.560 --> 12:10.350
You'll have to ask Senior Du.

234
12:10.990 --> 12:13.100
He's the one who said we should camp here.

235
12:13.100 --> 12:14.430
He's Chief Du's nephew.

236
12:14.920 --> 12:16.560
We do as he says.

237
12:17.230 --> 12:19.800
If one of the corpses really does rise, it'll be on him.

238
12:19.800 --> 12:20.990
Don't scare me.

239
12:27.960 --> 12:29.510
One of the corpses has turned!

240
12:29.510 --> 12:30.200
What?

241
12:33.870 --> 12:34.800
What's going on?

242
12:35.590 --> 12:36.720
A corpse has turned!

243
12:37.660 --> 12:39.510
When a corpse turns on the way home,

244
12:39.510 --> 12:41.320
it's either because the dead bore a grievance in life

245
12:41.320 --> 12:43.320
or met with misfortune after death.

246
12:44.200 --> 12:44.560
You,

247
12:44.990 --> 12:45.960
go see what's going on.

248
12:45.960 --> 12:46.680
Me?

249
12:46.780 --> 12:47.420
Go!

250
12:53.130 --> 12:54.080
Be careful.

251
13:46.220 --> 13:48.080
Oh my, it scared the life out of me.

252
13:49.400 --> 13:49.920
Oh my!

253
13:50.750 --> 13:51.230
Oh my!

254
13:53.040 --> 13:53.970
You damn monkey!

255
13:54.510 --> 13:57.040
They're already dead, and now they have to be mauled by monkeys.

256
13:57.040 --> 13:57.640
Senior Du,

257
13:57.920 --> 14:00.160
I told you we should've stayed at the mortuary.

258
14:00.160 --> 14:01.040
That damn monkey

259
14:01.040 --> 14:02.440
scared the hell out of me.

260
14:03.110 --> 14:04.470
Are the bodies all right?

261
14:04.470 --> 14:05.320
They're fine, they're fine.

262
14:05.320 --> 14:05.990
I checked them.

263
14:05.990 --> 14:06.920
They are intact.

264
14:07.800 --> 14:08.530
Silly Liang,

265
14:08.560 --> 14:09.320
give me a hand.

266
14:09.320 --> 14:10.350
It's almost daylight.

267
14:10.350 --> 14:12.210
Let's cover them with this cloth.

268
14:12.560 --> 14:13.510
One, two, lift.

269
14:23.830 --> 14:25.200
Greetings, Chief.

270
14:25.560 --> 14:27.760
Sorry to keep you waiting, Adjutant Xu.

271
14:28.870 --> 14:30.160
Chief Du,

272
14:30.370 --> 14:33.030
it's only a few steps to the Longxuya inner hall.

273
14:33.350 --> 14:35.440
Do you really need to lean on a human crutch?

274
14:35.440 --> 14:37.370
I've been waiting here for an hour.

275
14:37.470 --> 14:39.000
What are you going on about?

276
14:39.400 --> 14:41.110
I normally wouldn't, of course.

277
14:41.110 --> 14:43.240
But you came first thing this morning.

278
14:43.400 --> 14:44.890
You must have something important to discuss.

279
14:44.890 --> 14:46.220
I had to hurry, didn't I?

280
14:47.990 --> 14:49.120
All of you, get lost.

281
14:50.900 --> 14:51.900
You too, get lost.

282
14:57.400 --> 14:58.130
Adjutant Xu,

283
14:59.080 --> 15:00.610
Hey, hey. Let me remind you:

284
15:00.680 --> 15:01.830
I'm not in uniform today.

285
15:01.830 --> 15:03.290
Don't call me Adjutant Xu.

286
15:03.710 --> 15:05.310
Call me Mr. Zheng, all right?

287
15:05.680 --> 15:06.940
Okay, okay, Mr. Zheng.

288
15:06.950 --> 15:08.480
What brings you here today?

289
15:11.590 --> 15:14.520
Don't you think we need to get moving on our business?

290
15:14.630 --> 15:16.090
We discussed this before.

291
15:16.320 --> 15:18.160
If we're going to do this deal,

292
15:18.560 --> 15:20.800
we have to wait for things to die down.

293
15:21.320 --> 15:24.200
If your Colonel Lei hadn't been embezzling military pay

294
15:24.200 --> 15:26.370
to the point where he can't cover the shortfall anymore,

295
15:26.370 --> 15:28.400
we Longxuya wouldn't have had

296
15:28.400 --> 15:30.160
to risk our lives

297
15:30.380 --> 15:32.650
to take this deal.

298
15:33.200 --> 15:34.150
You...

299
15:40.990 --> 15:42.190
All right, all right.

300
15:42.830 --> 15:43.350
Mr. Du,

301
15:43.350 --> 15:44.800
you're right.

302
15:44.920 --> 15:46.400
From here on out,

303
15:46.400 --> 15:48.000
I'll do as you say, all right?

304
15:49.510 --> 15:50.200
But...

305
15:50.200 --> 15:52.800
But Commander Feng has given strict orders:

306
15:53.230 --> 15:55.830
anyone caught selling opium will be executed.

307
15:57.230 --> 15:59.160
Then what am I supposed to tell the Colonel?

308
15:59.160 --> 16:00.690
Go back and tell Colonel Lei

309
16:01.440 --> 16:03.470
I have another gift prepared for him.

310
16:03.470 --> 16:05.600
Not only will it make up for his losses,

311
16:05.710 --> 16:07.770
it'll even get him promoted one rank.

312
16:09.080 --> 16:10.110
How so?

313
16:10.830 --> 16:12.290
I have a trick up my sleeve.

314
16:13.400 --> 16:13.960
Ruhui,

315
16:14.110 --> 16:14.970
let me tell you,

316
16:15.350 --> 16:17.040
spearfishing takes skill.

317
16:17.230 --> 16:18.230
You can't just stab straight down,

318
16:18.230 --> 16:18.750
you know?

319
16:18.750 --> 16:20.410
You have to aim a little lower.

320
16:29.470 --> 16:30.000
See that?

321
16:30.130 --> 16:31.170
How's my skill?

322
16:32.870 --> 16:33.600
Pretty good.

323
16:34.190 --> 16:35.510
It'd be a shame not to make a fisherman out of you.

324
16:35.510 --> 16:36.040
Right?

325
16:36.830 --> 16:37.590
Liang.

326
16:38.440 --> 16:40.900
Why did you join Longxuya in the first place?

327
16:41.320 --> 16:42.560
Just to make a living.

328
16:44.630 --> 16:45.360
What's this?

329
16:48.990 --> 16:49.990
It's opium paste.

330
16:50.400 --> 16:52.060
What, you're into this stuff?

331
16:52.400 --> 16:52.920
What,

332
16:53.650 --> 16:54.250
want some?

333
16:54.590 --> 16:55.990
I don't touch this stuff.

334
16:56.280 --> 16:57.960
And I'd advise you not to either.

335
16:57.960 --> 16:58.400
I'm telling you,

336
16:58.400 --> 17:00.470
the new Commander Feng in Qianshan hates this stuff more than anything.

337
17:00.470 --> 17:03.330
If you get caught with it, you'll be shot on the spot.

338
17:04.440 --> 17:05.230
Then tell me,

339
17:05.599 --> 17:06.640
if our branch

340
17:06.839 --> 17:08.700
gets caught selling opium paste,

341
17:08.790 --> 17:10.450
what do you think will happen?

342
17:10.680 --> 17:11.609
What do you mean?

343
17:13.710 --> 17:15.010
This block of opium paste

344
17:15.010 --> 17:16.540
came out of a corpse.

345
17:17.310 --> 17:17.920
A corpse?

346
17:18.640 --> 17:19.310
You mean...

347
17:24.690 --> 17:26.410
you mean Senior Du?

348
17:26.960 --> 17:28.310
Now, is it

349
17:28.310 --> 17:29.310
worth losing your life

350
17:29.310 --> 17:29.960
just to make a living?

351
17:29.960 --> 17:30.920
Of course not.

352
17:31.810 --> 17:33.310
Maybe we should report it to the authorities.

353
17:33.310 --> 17:34.110
You fool.

354
17:34.130 --> 17:35.360
The opium paste is inside the corpse,

355
17:35.360 --> 17:36.600
and we're both corpse drivers.

356
17:36.600 --> 17:37.510
If we report it,

357
17:37.680 --> 17:39.840
how could either of us prove we have nothing to do with it?

358
17:39.840 --> 17:40.840
Then what do we do?

359
17:42.310 --> 17:43.170
We're done for.

360
17:44.550 --> 17:45.360
Liang,

361
17:46.360 --> 17:47.360
you said earlier

362
17:47.510 --> 17:48.550
that our branch has handled plenty

363
17:48.550 --> 17:50.080
of corpse-transport jobs.

364
17:50.270 --> 17:52.030
You really don't know

365
17:52.840 --> 17:54.570
what we've been transporting?

366
17:54.790 --> 17:55.990
Heaven and earth, gods and spirits above,

367
17:55.990 --> 17:56.920
I, Silly Liang, swear I have absolutely no idea.

368
17:56.920 --> 17:57.750
Even if I did know,

369
17:57.750 --> 17:59.840
I wouldn't dare get involved with them.

370
17:59.840 --> 18:00.680
We're done for, we're done for.

371
18:00.680 --> 18:01.510
If this gets discovered,

372
18:01.510 --> 18:02.970
we'll definitely be shot.

373
18:03.120 --> 18:04.070
I haven't even

374
18:04.070 --> 18:05.200
gotten married yet.

375
18:07.200 --> 18:08.470
How about we set fire to it,

376
18:08.470 --> 18:09.000
then run?

377
18:09.230 --> 18:09.880
No.

378
18:10.750 --> 18:12.330
We need to get back as soon as possible,

379
18:12.330 --> 18:14.640
and we need to take this batch of opium paste with us.

380
18:14.640 --> 18:15.320
Why?

381
18:16.940 --> 18:18.880
There's nothing you or I can do on the way.

382
18:18.880 --> 18:20.120
We can only find a way

383
18:20.440 --> 18:21.500
out of this dead end

384
18:21.500 --> 18:23.100
once we get back to Qianshan.

385
18:28.880 --> 18:30.660
You just said Commander Feng in Qianshan

386
18:30.660 --> 18:31.880
hates this stuff the most?

387
18:31.880 --> 18:32.410
Exactly.

388
18:35.840 --> 18:36.510
Senior Du,

389
18:37.510 --> 18:39.550
where are we putting the bodies once we get back to Qianshan?

390
18:39.550 --> 18:40.950
Yongzhen Taoist Temple.

391
18:41.120 --> 18:42.920
Once we deliver the bodies there

392
18:43.120 --> 18:44.400
and get them ready,

393
18:44.710 --> 18:46.550
the families will come on the fifth day of the lunar month.

394
18:46.550 --> 18:48.200
Once the funeral rites are done and the bodies are buried,

395
18:48.200 --> 18:49.200
our job

396
18:49.840 --> 18:50.840
will be finished.

397
18:52.600 --> 18:53.530
Three days left.

398
18:54.200 --> 18:55.600
We've got plenty of time.

399
18:58.470 --> 18:59.070
Senior Du,

400
18:59.440 --> 19:00.100
here you go.

401
19:00.310 --> 19:00.910
Is it done?

402
19:05.440 --> 19:06.160
Senior Du,

403
19:06.640 --> 19:07.440
if you ask me,

404
19:07.960 --> 19:10.070
we should take the main road from here.

405
19:10.070 --> 19:12.000
The sooner we get back, the better.

406
19:12.200 --> 19:13.600
There's war in the north.

407
19:13.920 --> 19:14.840
There are checkpoints

408
19:14.840 --> 19:16.440
everywhere on the main road,

409
19:16.710 --> 19:19.360
and the questioning alone will take us a lot more time.

410
19:19.360 --> 19:20.160
The back roads

411
19:20.440 --> 19:21.900
would be more manageable.

412
19:22.200 --> 19:24.710
Who's going to check us? We're corpse drivers.

413
19:24.710 --> 19:25.550
Besides, I think

414
19:25.550 --> 19:26.790
it might rain.

415
19:27.200 --> 19:28.880
The back roads will be muddy then.

416
19:28.880 --> 19:30.840
If anything goes wrong, we'll be in trouble.

417
19:30.840 --> 19:31.640
Besides,

418
19:32.030 --> 19:32.430
it's no good making the long,

419
19:32.430 --> 19:34.400
arduous journey back.

420
19:34.840 --> 19:36.200
Let's get into the city sooner.

421
19:36.200 --> 19:37.260
We can have some fun

422
19:37.360 --> 19:38.790
while we have the chance.

423
19:43.230 --> 19:43.830
All right.

424
19:44.840 --> 19:46.030
We'll take the main road

425
19:46.030 --> 19:47.230
as you suggest, then.

426
19:51.140 --> 19:52.380
I only speared two.

427
19:52.800 --> 19:54.330
How about I take a hit first?

428
20:07.190 --> 20:08.080
You go first.

429
20:08.470 --> 20:09.800
I'll go spear some more.

430
20:12.910 --> 20:13.670
Your papers.

431
20:14.650 --> 20:15.850
Here you go, officer.

432
20:20.960 --> 20:21.640
Who are you?

433
20:22.210 --> 20:24.470
What are you doing here, playing tricks?

434
20:24.550 --> 20:25.160
Officer,

435
20:25.640 --> 20:26.900
we're corpse drivers,

436
20:27.410 --> 20:28.640
taking the dead home.

437
20:29.310 --> 20:30.240
Corpse drivers?

438
20:31.340 --> 20:32.580
Are you planning

439
20:32.990 --> 20:34.640
to put on a play dressed like that?

440
20:34.640 --> 20:35.960
The corpse can move on its own?

441
20:35.960 --> 20:37.030
How do you do that?

442
20:37.440 --> 20:38.840
It's sorcery, passed down through generations.

443
20:38.840 --> 20:40.770
It's hard to explain in a few words.

444
20:43.470 --> 20:45.640
Let me see what kind of sorcery it is.

445
20:46.490 --> 20:47.060
Officer,

446
20:47.760 --> 20:48.710
this is a shroud.

447
20:48.920 --> 20:50.400
It doesn't have any pockets to hide anything in.

448
20:50.400 --> 20:51.360
We won't know

449
20:51.440 --> 20:52.500
until we search it.

450
20:54.680 --> 20:55.550
You can't undo the shroud.

451
20:55.550 --> 20:57.160
Otherwise, the three souls and seven spirits won't stay together.

452
20:57.160 --> 20:58.160
Get out of the way!

453
20:58.550 --> 20:59.710
How am I supposed to know

454
20:59.710 --> 21:01.510
what's inside if I don't undo it?

455
21:02.200 --> 21:03.360
I'll undo them all.

456
21:07.260 --> 21:08.340
Screw you!

457
21:18.030 --> 21:19.230
How dare you raise a hand to me!

458
21:19.230 --> 21:20.270
You've got a death wish.

459
21:20.270 --> 21:21.120
Beat him up!

460
21:27.030 --> 21:28.880
Stop! Stop! Please! Stop!

461
21:29.880 --> 21:30.510
Officer.

462
21:31.470 --> 21:32.840
How did these two come back to life?

463
21:32.840 --> 21:33.970
Human! We're human!

464
21:34.200 --> 21:35.440
Human!

465
21:36.310 --> 21:37.200
Living humans!

466
21:37.200 --> 21:37.880
It's a misunderstanding.

467
21:37.880 --> 21:38.510
Please,

468
21:38.640 --> 21:39.900
have mercy, officers.

469
21:39.920 --> 21:40.710
Officer,

470
21:40.840 --> 21:41.840
please calm down.

471
21:42.070 --> 21:42.880
My friend here

472
21:43.270 --> 21:44.210
has lived deep in the mountains all his life

473
21:44.210 --> 21:45.310
and doesn't know any better.

474
21:45.310 --> 21:46.090
He broke the rules.

475
21:46.090 --> 21:47.350
Please, go easy on him.

476
21:48.750 --> 21:49.780
Enough with the excuses!

477
21:49.780 --> 21:50.310
Officer.

478
21:50.440 --> 21:51.970
I'll put you somewhere else

479
21:51.990 --> 21:53.960
so you can cool off.

480
21:54.470 --> 21:55.270
Take him away!

481
21:55.310 --> 21:55.840
Officer!

482
21:55.990 --> 21:56.600
Get lost!

483
21:56.650 --> 21:57.180
No, wait.

484
21:57.820 --> 21:59.630
Officer, please don't take him away!

485
21:59.630 --> 22:00.600
Please don't!

486
22:02.310 --> 22:02.840
Officer!

487
22:03.270 --> 22:03.870
How dare he

488
22:03.920 --> 22:05.350
lay a hand on the officers?

489
22:05.350 --> 22:06.480
He acted too rashly.

490
22:06.830 --> 22:08.090
What are we going to do?

491
22:08.360 --> 22:08.990
How

492
22:09.350 --> 22:10.260
should I know?

493
22:11.000 --> 22:13.000
We'll figure it out when we get back.

494
22:26.750 --> 22:27.960
It's really heavy.

495
22:35.790 --> 22:37.030
Let me do it.

496
22:39.440 --> 22:40.040
Senior Du,

497
22:40.640 --> 22:42.500
we can't just leave Ruhui behind.

498
22:43.470 --> 22:44.310
How are we supposed to help?

499
22:44.310 --> 22:46.270
He brought it on himself by showing off.

500
22:46.270 --> 22:47.130
He deserves it!

501
22:47.440 --> 22:48.790
Calm down, calm down.

502
22:49.120 --> 22:50.780
Senior Du, you're so capable.

503
22:50.790 --> 22:52.390
Please, think of something.

504
22:55.540 --> 22:56.820
What rotten luck.

505
23:02.550 --> 23:03.950
Stay here and keep watch.

506
23:04.470 --> 23:05.440
It's our last night.

507
23:05.440 --> 23:07.040
Don't let anything go wrong.

508
23:07.200 --> 23:07.880
Okay.

509
23:13.120 --> 23:14.470
There has to be a way.

510
23:14.550 --> 23:17.120
It'll work.

511
23:23.070 --> 23:23.800
Adjutant Xu.

512
23:27.600 --> 23:28.580
What are you doing here?

513
23:28.580 --> 23:29.580
You scared me.

514
23:30.120 --> 23:30.920
Where are the goods?

515
23:30.920 --> 23:32.600
The goods are already at Yongzhen Taoist Temple outside the city.

516
23:32.600 --> 23:33.400
They'll reach

517
23:33.600 --> 23:34.550
Longxuya first thing tomorrow morning.

518
23:34.550 --> 23:37.710
Then why aren't you keeping an eye on the goods? What are you doing here?

519
23:37.710 --> 23:38.440
Adjutant Xu,

520
23:39.510 --> 23:41.400
one of my men got into a scuffle

521
23:41.630 --> 23:43.440
with the military police while passing through the city gate.

522
23:43.440 --> 23:44.640
He's been detained.

523
23:44.800 --> 23:45.690
Do you think you could—

524
23:45.690 --> 23:47.160
Nothing was exposed, right?

525
23:47.160 --> 23:47.920
Don't worry.

526
23:48.500 --> 23:49.430
Absolutely not.

527
23:51.020 --> 23:52.480
It's just one low-level man, isn't it?

528
23:52.480 --> 23:53.440
So what if they arrested him?

529
23:53.440 --> 23:54.310
At most, he'll get a beating

530
23:54.310 --> 23:55.880
and be released in a few days.

531
23:55.880 --> 23:57.070
That's true, but,

532
23:57.470 --> 23:58.200
Adjutant Xu,

533
23:58.350 --> 23:59.480
this man is involved

534
23:59.570 --> 24:01.290
in the gift for Colonel Lei.

535
24:02.030 --> 24:02.990
What do you mean?

536
24:03.470 --> 24:04.000
I mean...

537
24:07.230 --> 24:10.160
You really are good at messing things up.

538
24:11.710 --> 24:12.400
Wait here.

539
24:12.400 --> 24:13.330
I'll make a call.

540
24:13.880 --> 24:15.210
Thank you, Adjutant Xu.

541
24:18.400 --> 24:19.840
May Ruhui be safe

542
24:19.980 --> 24:21.440
and return here unharmed.

543
24:28.230 --> 24:29.760
How did you end up so beat up?

544
24:30.130 --> 24:31.130
Come on, let's go.

545
24:34.630 --> 24:35.630
Are you all right?

546
24:35.920 --> 24:37.120
Those bastards...

547
24:37.190 --> 24:38.360
If they hadn't had guns,

548
24:38.360 --> 24:38.680
I would've—

549
24:38.680 --> 24:39.310
I'd have taken

550
24:39.310 --> 24:40.570
every one of them down.

551
24:41.600 --> 24:42.710
Forget about that.

552
24:43.270 --> 24:44.990
You're back safe, and that's what matters.

553
24:44.990 --> 24:45.710
Ruhui,

554
24:45.990 --> 24:46.710
no offense,

555
24:47.200 --> 24:48.860
but you've got quite a temper.

556
24:49.980 --> 24:51.380
You're right, Senior Du.

557
24:51.850 --> 24:53.180
I won't dare do it again.

558
24:53.920 --> 24:54.470
I know

559
24:54.990 --> 24:56.560
you did it for our Longxuya Branch.

560
24:56.560 --> 24:58.110
If anything had happened to the bodies,

561
24:58.110 --> 25:00.840
we'd have had a hard time explaining it tomorrow.

562
25:01.070 --> 25:02.680
Thank you for understanding, Senior Du.

563
25:02.680 --> 25:03.540
How about this?

564
25:03.840 --> 25:04.970
I'll get us some food

565
25:05.310 --> 25:07.100
and give you a proper welcome back.

566
25:07.100 --> 25:07.700
Senior Du,

567
25:07.980 --> 25:09.240
you really shouldn't.

568
25:09.750 --> 25:11.340
I just caused you so much trouble,

569
25:11.340 --> 25:12.340
and yet you still—

570
25:12.880 --> 25:13.550
Ruhui,

571
25:14.230 --> 25:14.990
say no more.

572
25:15.200 --> 25:16.510
I've seen how you've performed

573
25:16.510 --> 25:17.550
throughout this trip.

574
25:17.550 --> 25:18.200
Besides,

575
25:18.540 --> 25:19.270
you could say

576
25:19.320 --> 25:20.920
we've finished this job smoothly enough.

577
25:20.920 --> 25:21.550
Tonight,

578
25:21.790 --> 25:22.470
let's have

579
25:22.790 --> 25:24.030
a good drink together.

580
25:24.030 --> 25:24.710
Get some rest first

581
25:24.710 --> 25:26.110
and change your clothes.

582
25:27.990 --> 25:29.520
Come on, sit down, sit down.

583
25:32.920 --> 25:34.250
You're this badly hurt.

584
25:34.440 --> 25:35.970
No drinking tonight, okay?

585
25:37.880 --> 25:39.080
Thank you, Senior Du.

586
25:39.400 --> 25:40.120
Cheers.

587
25:43.750 --> 25:44.350
Senior Du,

588
25:44.600 --> 25:45.780
thank you for being so forgiving despite my mistake.

589
25:45.780 --> 25:47.200
I'd like to raise a toast to you.

590
25:47.200 --> 25:47.960
No need to be so formal, Ruhui.

591
25:47.960 --> 25:48.990
Thank you, Senior Du.

592
25:48.990 --> 25:49.840
You've worked hard on this journey.

593
25:49.840 --> 25:50.470
Thank you.

594
25:50.660 --> 25:51.590
You're welcome.

595
25:55.470 --> 25:56.120
Let's raise

596
25:56.120 --> 25:57.230
another toast to Senior Du.

597
25:57.230 --> 25:57.600
Here.

598
25:57.600 --> 25:58.470
It's my duty.

599
25:58.990 --> 26:00.030
Bottoms up.

600
26:09.510 --> 26:10.680
Senior Du,

601
26:12.380 --> 26:13.210
this cup...

602
26:40.680 --> 26:41.550
Ruhui!

603
26:42.350 --> 26:43.030
Ruhui,

604
26:43.680 --> 26:44.440
get up.

605
26:44.440 --> 26:45.030
Wake up.

606
26:46.440 --> 26:47.370
Morning, Liang.

607
26:47.390 --> 26:48.840
Forget the pleasantries. Something's happened.

608
26:48.840 --> 26:49.950
Senior Du is missing.

609
26:49.950 --> 26:52.160
I've looked everywhere, but I can't find him.

610
26:52.160 --> 26:53.270
Maybe he got up early

611
26:53.270 --> 26:55.070
and went out for a walk.

612
26:55.070 --> 26:56.070
Why are you getting so worked up?

613
26:56.070 --> 26:57.100
It's not that I'm getting worked up for nothing.

614
26:57.100 --> 26:59.430
All the valuables he brought are gone too.

615
27:01.680 --> 27:02.810
Could those corpses

616
27:02.920 --> 27:04.230
have risen

617
27:04.380 --> 27:05.840
and killed him last night?

618
27:07.010 --> 27:08.820
Why would they hurt us

619
27:09.230 --> 27:10.470
after we carried them all the way back?

620
27:10.470 --> 27:11.510
Then go ask them.

621
27:14.400 --> 27:14.990
Liang,

622
27:18.110 --> 27:20.170
have you ever been bullied by ghosts?

623
27:20.350 --> 27:20.870
No.

624
27:21.050 --> 27:23.180
I've only ever been bullied by people.

625
27:27.540 --> 27:28.670
Where are you going?

626
27:37.180 --> 27:39.780
This doesn't look like a corpse rising either.

627
27:47.350 --> 27:48.280
A gunshot wound.

628
27:49.330 --> 27:50.730
Open it up and take a look.

629
27:53.070 --> 27:54.200
Where's the stuff?

630
27:54.710 --> 27:55.230
Liang,

631
27:55.610 --> 27:57.940
go check the other four corpses. Quickly.

632
28:21.430 --> 28:23.190
All the opium paste is gone—

633
28:23.280 --> 28:25.740
how come two blocks were left in this corpse?

634
28:40.400 --> 28:40.960
Liang,

635
28:42.070 --> 28:43.870
remember what I told you before?

636
28:44.510 --> 28:45.790
Ghosts never hurt you.

637
28:46.840 --> 28:47.670
It's people

638
28:48.680 --> 28:49.440
who do.

639
29:00.050 --> 29:01.130
Easy, Sir.

640
29:01.350 --> 29:02.350
This way, please.

641
29:18.310 --> 29:18.920
Mr. Zheng?

642
29:22.120 --> 29:23.750
Have you fried your brain on that damn opium?

643
29:23.750 --> 29:24.680
Take a good look.

644
29:25.030 --> 29:26.120
My surname is Xu.

645
29:26.670 --> 29:27.230
Search them.

646
29:27.230 --> 29:28.430
-Yes, sir. -Yes, sir.

647
29:36.440 --> 29:36.990
Let's go.

648
29:42.440 --> 29:43.070
Found it.

649
29:44.840 --> 29:45.400
Colonel,

650
29:45.640 --> 29:46.440
we found this.

651
29:54.150 --> 29:54.870
You two,

652
29:56.120 --> 29:57.320
anything else to say?

653
29:58.790 --> 29:59.440
Officer,

654
29:59.710 --> 30:01.160
we didn't put this there.

655
30:01.790 --> 30:02.550
Then who did?

656
30:04.030 --> 30:04.640
He did.

657
30:05.920 --> 30:07.440
Didn't you get beaten enough?

658
30:07.440 --> 30:08.770
Stop talking nonsense.

659
30:09.310 --> 30:10.720
You're caught red-handed,

660
30:10.720 --> 30:12.220
and you still dare accuse an officer.

661
30:12.220 --> 30:14.180
Looks like you won't tell the truth

662
30:14.430 --> 30:15.830
until I teach you a lesson.

663
30:15.830 --> 30:16.310
Sir.

664
30:16.550 --> 30:17.210
Attention!

665
30:26.820 --> 30:28.150
Greetings, Commander.

666
30:33.070 --> 30:34.930
What brings you here, Commander?

667
30:47.290 --> 30:48.770
No need to trouble yourself, Commander.

668
30:48.770 --> 30:50.430
I've already taken care of it.

669
30:50.460 --> 30:51.590
Caught red-handed.

670
30:51.950 --> 30:54.680
Didn't you say opium had been completely banned?

671
30:54.940 --> 30:55.550
Well,

672
30:56.680 --> 30:57.600
these two

673
30:57.960 --> 30:59.270
are outrageously bold—

674
30:59.270 --> 31:00.550
carrying on their crimes

675
31:00.550 --> 31:02.420
right under our noses despite the crackdown.

676
31:02.420 --> 31:04.150
Don't worry, Commander. I'll—

677
31:14.140 --> 31:16.140
I'll interrogate these two myself.

678
31:16.550 --> 31:17.200
Um...

679
31:18.250 --> 31:18.910
Commander,

680
31:19.070 --> 31:19.840
these two

681
31:19.840 --> 31:20.970
never tell the truth

682
31:21.070 --> 31:22.100
No need to trouble yourself.

683
31:22.100 --> 31:23.030
Leave them to us.

684
31:28.580 --> 31:29.730
You have no say in this.

685
31:29.730 --> 31:30.190
Get out!

686
31:30.750 --> 31:31.280
Yes, sir.

687
31:32.310 --> 31:33.070
Take them all away.

688
31:33.070 --> 31:33.600
Yes, sir.

689
31:33.680 --> 31:34.540
Take them away.

690
32:16.030 --> 32:16.560
How is it?

691
32:23.840 --> 32:24.570
Colonel Lei,

692
32:25.590 --> 32:26.970
the goods have arrived safely.

693
32:26.970 --> 32:28.770
Why do you still look so worried?

694
32:30.840 --> 32:33.070
Longxuya risked everything

695
32:33.140 --> 32:34.210
to cover my losses.

696
32:34.650 --> 32:35.730
I, Lei, would like

697
32:36.080 --> 32:37.880
to thank you first and foremost.

698
32:38.200 --> 32:39.120
It's just...

699
32:39.550 --> 32:41.920
It's just that those two fall guys

700
32:41.920 --> 32:44.360
have ended up in Commander Feng's hands.

701
32:45.050 --> 32:47.650
You can't help but worry, can you, Colonel Lei?

702
32:51.510 --> 32:52.680
Looks like

703
32:53.160 --> 32:54.470
you already have a solution.

704
32:54.470 --> 32:55.120
If you ask me,

705
32:55.120 --> 32:56.030
Colonel Lei,

706
32:56.030 --> 32:58.440
you can put your mind at ease.

707
32:58.680 --> 32:59.750
There's no need to worry.

708
32:59.750 --> 33:01.550
Commander Feng has no evidence.

709
33:01.550 --> 33:03.840
Why would he believe the nonsense

710
33:03.990 --> 33:05.520
those two swindlers spout?

711
33:05.640 --> 33:06.470
If anything

712
33:06.470 --> 33:08.990
does turn up later

713
33:08.990 --> 33:10.520
and it comes back to you two,

714
33:10.960 --> 33:13.290
just insist that it's a false accusation,

715
33:13.370 --> 33:15.570
and you'll have nothing to worry about.

716
33:16.460 --> 33:16.990
Chief Du,

717
33:18.070 --> 33:19.130
I'll still need you

718
33:19.480 --> 33:20.850
to help me find buyers for this shipment.

719
33:20.850 --> 33:23.250
I'll let you know as soon as I have an update.

720
33:24.600 --> 33:25.200
All right.

721
33:25.440 --> 33:27.040
We won't keep you any longer.

722
33:28.790 --> 33:29.310
Please.

723
33:34.270 --> 33:35.160
Take care, gentlemen.

724
33:35.160 --> 33:35.760
All right.

725
33:46.120 --> 33:46.640
Uncle,

726
33:47.510 --> 33:49.040
the buyer for this shipment

727
33:49.160 --> 33:50.290
is already lined up.

728
33:50.680 --> 33:52.230
When should we make the delivery?

729
33:52.230 --> 33:52.750
No rush.

730
33:53.540 --> 33:54.800
Wait for further word.

731
33:55.120 --> 33:57.160
Only once that Lyu Ruhui is dead

732
33:57.660 --> 33:58.660
can everything

733
33:58.790 --> 34:00.220
finally be settled.

734
34:01.030 --> 34:01.790
Heng.

735
34:02.570 --> 34:05.050
Do as I told you before.

736
34:05.640 --> 34:07.160
Once this is over,

737
34:07.640 --> 34:09.969
take the money you've saved over the years

738
34:10.400 --> 34:12.150
and leave Qianshan.

739
34:12.400 --> 34:13.860
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

740
34:14.150 --> 34:14.679
Uncle...

741
34:15.239 --> 34:16.840
Never come back.

742
34:18.190 --> 34:18.760
Uncle,

743
34:19.929 --> 34:20.790
what about you?

744
34:21.270 --> 34:23.230
I know too much.

745
34:24.280 --> 34:27.280
I'm afraid I'll have to spend the rest of my days in the Tianxiang Sect.

746
34:27.280 --> 34:28.880
But as long as I'm still here,

747
34:28.960 --> 34:31.330
no one will care where you go.

748
34:32.730 --> 34:34.520
That's why I can't leave.

749
34:35.989 --> 34:36.510
Uncle,

750
34:36.889 --> 34:37.620
how about...

751
34:42.159 --> 34:44.360
I'll go back to my room and get some rest.

752
34:57.050 --> 35:00.530
When did you pick up this opium habit?

753
35:03.300 --> 35:03.760
Uncle,

754
35:03.880 --> 35:04.320
you...

755
35:13.060 --> 35:15.420
I told you before,

756
35:15.960 --> 35:17.670
I won't interfere with your drinking, eating,

757
35:17.670 --> 35:19.030
whoring, or gambling.

758
35:19.180 --> 35:20.300
But you absolutely

759
35:20.610 --> 35:22.010
cannot touch opium.

760
35:30.630 --> 35:31.240
Uncle,

761
35:32.070 --> 35:33.070
I know I was wrong.

762
35:33.550 --> 35:33.960
I...

763
35:35.070 --> 35:36.030
I'll quit.

764
35:37.460 --> 35:38.590
I promise I'll quit.

765
36:27.090 --> 36:30.770
[Half a month later]

766
36:57.550 --> 36:58.920
Gentlemen,

767
36:59.280 --> 37:01.080
you've all inspected the goods.

768
37:01.240 --> 37:02.320
Satisfied?

769
37:02.360 --> 37:04.320
Satisfied.

770
37:04.440 --> 37:05.470
Very satisfied.

771
37:06.070 --> 37:06.960
Good to hear.

772
37:07.840 --> 37:08.630
However,

773
37:09.470 --> 37:11.000
the price for this shipment

774
37:11.470 --> 37:13.870
will be 30% higher than originally agreed.

775
37:14.510 --> 37:15.070
Well...

776
37:18.190 --> 37:20.510
You all know what things are like in Qianshan.

777
37:20.510 --> 37:21.670
We lost quite a few of our men

778
37:21.670 --> 37:23.270
getting this shipment here.

779
37:23.360 --> 37:24.760
The extra 30%

780
37:25.030 --> 37:27.760
will go toward the burial expenses for those men.

781
37:27.880 --> 37:28.840
Do we have a deal?

782
37:31.190 --> 37:31.650
Well...

783
37:33.720 --> 37:34.450
Adjutant Xu,

784
37:34.720 --> 37:36.920
that's quite a difference

785
37:36.920 --> 37:38.110
from the price we agreed on.

786
37:38.110 --> 37:39.150
I don't have

787
37:39.240 --> 37:41.510
that much cash on hand right now.

788
37:41.990 --> 37:44.550
Why don't you offer it to someone else?

789
37:44.800 --> 37:45.760
I'll pass

790
37:47.280 --> 37:48.920
on this shipment.

791
37:49.470 --> 37:50.200
Adjutant Xu,

792
37:50.230 --> 37:51.410
I'm short on cash too.

793
37:51.410 --> 37:53.210
I'll have to pass.

794
37:55.550 --> 37:57.550
I've been too nice to you, haven't I?

795
38:03.110 --> 38:03.760
Speak up!

796
38:05.470 --> 38:06.730
Let me make this clear:

797
38:06.840 --> 38:08.440
you're taking this shipment

798
38:08.800 --> 38:10.150
whether you want it

799
38:11.070 --> 38:12.320
or not.

800
38:13.760 --> 38:15.020
Do I make myself clear?

801
38:37.190 --> 38:37.880
Commander,

802
38:38.240 --> 38:39.440
what brings you here?

803
38:42.840 --> 38:44.740
Commander, you may have misunderstood.

804
38:44.740 --> 38:46.220
Adjutant Xu and I

805
38:46.400 --> 38:47.360
were trying to lure them out,

806
38:47.360 --> 38:48.070
wipe

807
38:48.630 --> 38:49.440
them all out,

808
38:49.760 --> 38:50.360
and then

809
38:50.510 --> 38:51.570
report back to you.

810
38:54.470 --> 38:55.330
Premium goods.

811
38:56.280 --> 38:57.720
I was just outside

812
38:57.760 --> 38:59.620
and I think I heard Adjutant Xu say

813
39:00.070 --> 39:01.280
that the price for this shipment

814
39:01.280 --> 39:03.190
is 30% higher than usual.

815
39:03.470 --> 39:06.270
And it seems you weren't willing to pay, am I right?

816
39:08.720 --> 39:10.800
I don't quite understand.

817
39:12.400 --> 39:14.130
Why weren't you willing to pay?

818
39:14.990 --> 39:16.150
This shipment was brought here

819
39:16.150 --> 39:18.110
inside the bodies of my fallen men.

820
39:18.820 --> 39:21.300
They gave their lives for me.

821
39:21.320 --> 39:22.920
They didn't even get a proper burial.

822
39:22.920 --> 39:23.720
Instead,

823
39:24.240 --> 39:26.550
their riddled corpses

824
39:26.880 --> 39:27.550
were cut

825
39:27.590 --> 39:28.320
open,

826
39:28.410 --> 39:30.920
their insides removed, every last organ taken out.

827
39:30.920 --> 39:32.150
If I'm not mistaken,

828
39:32.150 --> 39:33.030
the cleaner

829
39:33.280 --> 39:34.920
they were emptied out, the better, right?

830
39:34.920 --> 39:36.310
Because that's the only way

831
39:36.310 --> 39:38.090
you can pack in more opium paste,

832
39:38.090 --> 39:39.300
sew them back up,

833
39:39.400 --> 39:40.590
and haul them

834
39:40.670 --> 39:41.320
here

835
39:41.320 --> 39:42.850
through all that hardship,

836
39:45.470 --> 39:46.870
so you can make a fortune.

837
39:47.070 --> 39:49.360
They died clean.

838
39:49.590 --> 39:51.320
Now their bodies have been defiled.

839
39:51.320 --> 39:52.320
Under

840
39:52.470 --> 39:54.110
Under these circumstances,

841
39:54.400 --> 39:58.110
isn't a 30% price increase only fair?

842
40:18.360 --> 40:19.880
I heard you're blind.

843
40:24.920 --> 40:25.920
You're not blind.

844
40:30.260 --> 40:32.180
You just think I'm the blind one.

845
40:35.190 --> 40:36.120
Commander Feng,

846
40:36.920 --> 40:39.110
I've always had great respect for you soldiers.

847
40:39.110 --> 40:41.680
I was deceived by Colonel Lei too.

848
40:41.880 --> 40:44.800
He told me these bodies belonged to miners who had died in an accident.

849
40:44.800 --> 40:46.960
I was only running an errand for him,

850
40:47.400 --> 40:49.400
making a little money for my trouble.

851
40:49.400 --> 40:50.400
You know full well

852
40:50.990 --> 40:53.030
how many dirty deeds you've all been involved in

853
40:53.030 --> 40:54.570
behind the scenes over the years.

854
40:54.570 --> 40:55.970
Now that he's dead,

855
41:06.400 --> 41:07.920
you're next.

856
41:09.800 --> 41:11.110
I see.

857
41:12.990 --> 41:13.670
Kid,

858
41:13.760 --> 41:15.190
if I'd known this would happen,

859
41:15.190 --> 41:16.850
I should've killed you myself

860
41:17.400 --> 41:19.550
back at Longxuya.

861
41:27.380 --> 41:28.220
Du Binghui,

862
41:28.790 --> 41:29.940
you're not dead yet.

863
41:31.290 --> 41:32.770
How could I bear to die?

864
41:48.880 --> 41:50.150
We're corpse drivers,

865
41:50.150 --> 41:51.440
taking the dead home.

866
41:51.530 --> 41:53.300
You're dressed

867
41:53.380 --> 41:55.580
as if you were about to perform in a play.

868
41:56.150 --> 41:57.150
How fascinating.

869
41:57.280 --> 41:59.150
The corpse can even move on its own.

870
41:59.150 --> 42:00.550
How do you do that?

871
42:01.350 --> 42:02.510
[Blind Du isn't blind]

872
42:06.880 --> 42:08.400
I'll put you somewhere else

873
42:08.400 --> 42:10.190
so you can cool off.

874
42:10.190 --> 42:10.800
Move!

875
42:15.830 --> 42:17.160
Where are you taking me?

876
42:20.550 --> 42:21.510
Wait here.

877
42:27.850 --> 42:49.510
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

878
42:57.870 --> 42:59.240
This is the new performer.

879
42:59.240 --> 42:59.990
Her stage name is Feiyan.

880
42:59.990 --> 43:00.800
What are you doing?

881
43:00.800 --> 43:01.800
What are you doing?

882
43:01.800 --> 43:03.920
No one has ever celebrated my birthday for me.

883
43:03.920 --> 43:04.590
Thank you.

884
43:04.670 --> 43:05.270
Mom,

885
43:05.510 --> 43:06.360
I'll go get a doctor.

886
43:06.360 --> 43:07.990
You haven't eaten anything all night.

887
43:07.990 --> 43:08.990
Come and have some porridge.

888
43:08.990 --> 43:10.240
Since we've tied the knot,

889
43:10.240 --> 43:11.190
we're husband and wife.

890
43:11.190 --> 43:12.360
Your business is my business.

891
43:12.360 --> 43:13.440
How can I stay out of it?

892
43:13.440 --> 43:14.360
From now on,

893
43:14.440 --> 43:16.150
every minute and every second

894
43:16.440 --> 43:17.510
belongs to us.

895
43:17.840 --> 43:18.800
I once

896
43:19.150 --> 43:21.190
ran into an old gentleman surnamed Du.

897
43:21.190 --> 43:22.920
He said I was born to bring ruin,

898
43:22.920 --> 43:24.630
first to my parents and friends,

899
43:24.630 --> 43:26.090
then to any devoted lover.

900
43:26.240 --> 43:27.770
Everyone who treats me well

901
43:27.840 --> 43:28.590
ends up

902
43:29.280 --> 43:30.550
dying because of me.

903
43:34.450 --> 43:36.710
[In the next episode]

904
43:36.840 --> 43:37.990
Liang,

905
43:38.110 --> 43:39.470
my name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

906
43:39.840 --> 43:41.640
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

907
43:42.180 --> 43:44.380
The road I'm about to take is dangerous.

908
43:44.540 --> 43:45.690
We should go our separate ways.

909
43:45.690 --> 43:47.820
If you're in danger, all the more reason I should come with you.

910
43:47.820 --> 43:49.880
What if I have to kill the Sect Master?

911
43:50.570 --> 43:51.780
Take my advice.

912
43:51.990 --> 43:53.450
Leave the Tianxiang Sect.

913
43:53.930 --> 43:55.140
None of them

914
43:56.060 --> 43:57.270
will die a peaceful death.
